y Design (token auth, localhost bind)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web chat requires an X-Jarvis-Token header and rejects foreign Origins so other sites/tabs cannot silently trigger actions; Flask binds only to 127.0.0.1 so it is unreachable from the network; guard-connectors.ps1 enforces the Outlook read-only rule at the tool level regardless of what is asked; generated/sensitive files are gitignored to avoid leaking tokens/session data."}, {"id": "readme_gotchas", "label": "Common Gotchas (lessons learned)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Git does not track empty folders, so PARA vault folders got .gitkeep placeholders after a clone-and-check restore test showed they were silently missing; concurrent pushes to main are a known unresolved risk now that cloud routines, the git-backup hook, and manual commits all target the same branch; PowerShell Get-Content -Raw round-trips can corrupt umlauts, so Claude's own Edit tool is preferred; JSON paths need forward slashes for settings.json; app.py now refuses to start if port 8420 is already bound, to prevent silent dual-instance conflicts."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_document", "target": "readme_orb_dashboard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_document", "target": "readme_flask_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_document", "target": "readme_hook_set_thinking", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "sou